{title: 260 - Hover O'er Me, Holy Spirit}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #260 • SWENEY • 15.15.13.15}
{lyricist: Ellwood H. Stokes}
{composer: John R. Sweney}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 260}
{meta: tune SWENEY}
{meta: meter 15.15.13.15}
{meta: category Holy Spirit - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F/C]Hover o'er [Gm/Bb]me, Holy [F]Spirit, [Dm/F]Bathe my [Gm/Bb]trembling [F/C]heart [C7]and brow;
[Bb]Fill me [C]with Thy [F/C]hallowed [C]presence, [F/C]Come, O [Gm/Bb]come and [Dm/A]fill me [F]now.
[Dm/F]Fill me now, [Gm/Bb]fill [F/C]me now, [C7]Jesus, [F/C]come and [Gm/Bb]fill [Dm/A]me now.
[C]Fill me with Thy hallowed [F/C]presence, Come, [Am]O [Bb]come and fill me [C]now.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[F/C]Fill me [C]now, [F/C]fill me [C]now,
[F/C]Jesus, come [Gm/Bb]and fill [Dm/A]me [F]now.
[Dm/F]Fill me with [Gm/Bb]Thy [F/C]hallowed [C7]presence,
[F/C]Come, O [Gm/Bb]come and [Dm/A]fill me now.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F/C]Thou canst [Gm/Bb]fill [F]me, [Dm/F]gracious [F/C]Spirit,
[Bb]Though [C]I [F/C]cannot tell [Gm/Bb]Thee [Dm/A]how;
[Dm/F]But I [Gm/Bb]need [F/C]Thee, [C7]greatly [Gm/Bb]need [Dm/A]Thee;
[C]Come, O come [F/C]and [Am]fill [Bb]me now.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F/C]I am [Gm/Bb]weakness, [Dm/F]full of [F/C]weakness;
[Bb]At [C]Thy sacred [F/C]feet [Gm/Bb]I [Dm/A]bow;
[Dm/F]Blest, divine, [F/C]eternal [Gm/Bb]Spirit,
[C]Fill with love, [F/C]and [Am]fill [Bb]me now.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[F/C]Cleanse and [Gm/Bb]comfort, [Dm/F]bless and [F/C]save [C7]me;
[Bb]Bathe, [C]O, [F/C]bathe [C]my [F/C]heart [Gm/Bb]and [Dm/A]brow;
[Dm/F]Thou art [Gm/Bb]comforting [F/C]and [Gm/Bb]saving,
[C]Thou art sweetly [Am]filling [Bb]now.
{end_of_verse}
